    "text": "WRGB\nwebsite\nAlbany\nAlbany man fails to appear in court, faces arrest warrant in grand larceny case\nBy Laura Gemmett,\n18 hours agoRensselaer County, N.Y. (WRGB) — An Albany man, Devin Zielinski, failed to appear in court today for his sentencing in a grand larceny case involving the theft of over $200,000 from an elderly man. As a result, a warrant is expected to be issued for his arrest, and he now risks facing a harsher sentence.\n27",
